  "html": "<p>感謝各位師長、校友及新生的參與和支持，使第二屆新生破冰營活動圓滿結束！祝福所有 113 級的學長姐們在未來的學習生活中收穫滿滿，享受每一刻充實的時光。</p>\n<p><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/yL7lnES5oyM\" title=\"113/08/18 第二屆 113 新生破冰營\"></iframe></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"266\" src=\"/legacy/img/af4b77d4e5-001.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/legacy/img/a726182944-s-89505806-0.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"266\" src=\"/legacy/img/ddb551d0e4-002.jpg\" width=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p>活動合照&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 活動合照</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"266\" src=\"/legacy/img/83b5784977-003.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"266\" src=\"/legacy/img/6e9244aa2c-004.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>工程學院 王丞浩副院長致詞&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; EMRD 游進陽執行長致詞</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"266\" src=\"/legacy/img/27e1891139-005.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"266\" src=\"/legacy/img/033fb312fd-006.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>EMRD 蔡孟霖副執行長致詞&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; EMRD 113&nbsp;級蔡孟涵班導師致詞</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"266\" src=\"/legacy/img/b5e97c36b0-007.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"266\" src=\"/legacy/img/39682f5e4d-008.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>SEMI-EMRD 邱昱誠執行長致詞&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;SEMI-EMRD 田維欣副執行長致詞</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"266\" src=\"/legacy/img/10afea7551-009.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"266\" src=\"/legacy/img/784eabcf90-010.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>SEMI-EMRD 黃中人班導師致詞&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; EMRD 吳欽文理事長致詞</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"266\" src=\"/legacy/img/e3af261f70-011.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"266\" src=\"/legacy/img/fd6d6edc61-012.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>EMRD 李定為副理事長致詞&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;EMRD 賴晉輝前理事長致詞</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"266\" src=\"/legacy/img/d3bd84477c-013.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"266\" src=\"/legacy/img/a7c33d5a75-014.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>EMRD 梁進校友致詞&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 活動合照</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"266\" src=\"/legacy/img/1ef50dbb66-015.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"266\" src=\"/legacy/img/142a571b25-016.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>活動合照&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 團康活動</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"266\" src=\"/legacy/img/ee45570c42-017.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>活動合照</p>",
